If A04_WholeBuildingOccupancyincludes one or more of the following: EventsExhibits, LibraryBuilding, HotelMotel, OfficeBuilding, FinancialInstitutionBuilding, UnleasedTenantSpace, MedicalClinicBuilding, RestaurantBuilding, RetailBuilding, GroceryStoreBuilding, SchoolBuilding, Warehouse, ReligiousFacilityBuilding, SportsRecreation, HighRiseResidential
