            <xsd:element name="A05Message" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">NOT REPORTED IN PDF</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:b>
                    <d:i>STOP!  Alterations or additions that increase roof area by <d:lte/> 2,000 ft<d:sup>2</d:sup> are not required to comply with requirements in <d:t24refnolink/>110.10/ <d:t24refnolink/>140.10/ <d:t24refnolink/>170.2(g and h) and do not need to complete this compliance document.</d:i>
                  </d:b>
