      </xsd:element>
      <xsd:element name="Section_B" minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="1">
        <xsd:annotation>
          <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">
            <d:b> B. PROJECT SCOPE</d:b>
          </xsd:documentation>
          <xsd:documentation source="MinOccurs">This section is required.</xsd:documentation>
        </xsd:annotation>
        <xsd:complexType>
          <xsd:sequence>
            <xsd:element name="B_BeginNote1" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:i>The compliance path the project is using to comply per <d:t24refnolink/>110.10(b)1B/ <d:t24refnolink/>140.10/ <d:t24refnolink/>170.2(g and h) is indicated below. </d:i>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="BSolarReady" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Compliance with Solar Readiness Requirements in <d:t24refnolink/>110.10(b)1B</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">If this subsection is required,  one and only one item can be checked with a result == true and it is the only item that is displayed in the final report.
 
Conditions when this subsection is required or not required
 
If Bpv Is not required and NotPresent and A05_RoofConstRangeSolar != AddAltRoofLTE2000ft2
BSolarReady is REQUIRED
Else If Bpv Is required and IsPresent And 
Bpv01b_AccessAreaTooSmall == true OR 
Bpv01c_RequiredLT4kW == true OR 
Bpv01d_NoContiguousAccess OR
Bpv01e_SnowloadException == true Or 
Bpv0f_MultitenantException == true Or
Bpv01g_FloorAreaException == true
BSolarReady is REQUIRED</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
              <xsd:complexType>
                <xsd:sequence>
                  <xsd:element name="B01a_IsProjectAllocatedSolarZone" type="comp:IsProjectAllocatedSolarZone">
                    <xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Provide Solar Ready Area no exceptions</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The project has allocated a solar zone on the roof plan per requirements in <d:t24ref h="110.10(b)"/>, as documented in Table F.</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">By default result = false and unchecked.  If user checks it, the result = true,
 
If result == false NOT REPORTED IN PDF
 
Mandatory Measure Triggers:
If result == true
MM110_10b1B_MeasureApplies  = true and is displayed And 
MM110_10b4_MeasureApplies  = true and is displayed And 
DUMM110_10b2_MeasureApplies  = true and is displayed And 
DUMM110_10b3_MeasureApplies  = true and is displayed And 
DUMM110_10b4_MeasureApplies  = true and is displayed And 
DUMM110_10c_MeasureApplies  = true and is displayed And 
DUMM110_10d_MeasureApplies  = true and is displayed And 
End If</xsd:documentation>
                    </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="B01b_IsProjectInstalledPhotovoltaicSystem" type="comp:IsProjectInstalledPhotovoltaicSystem">
                    <xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Exception to Solar Ready Area: Installed Solar Photovoltaic System</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The project includes a permanently installed solar electric system having a nameplate DC power rating, measured under Standard Test Conditions, of no less than one watt per square foot of roof area as documented in Table G.</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">By default result = false and unchecked.  If user checks it, the result = true,  
If result == true Section G is triggered 
Else If result == false 
field NOT REPORTED IN PDF
End If</xsd:documentation>
                    </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
                    <xsd:element name="B01c_IsProjectInstalledSolarWaterHeating" type="comp:IsProjectInstalledSolarWaterHeating">
                      <xsd:annotation>
                        <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Exception to Solar Ready Area: Installed Solar Water Heating System</xsd:documentation>
                        <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The project  is a hotel/motel or high-rise multifamily occupancy and includes a permanently installed domestic solar water-heating system complying with <d:t24refnolink/>170.2(d)2Bii and Reference Residential Appendix RA4, as documented in Table H.</xsd:documentation>
                        <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">If A04_WholeBuilding ccupancy == HighRiseResidential Or HotelMotel  by default result = false and unchecked;  If user checks it, the result = true, 
If result == true Section H is triggered 
Else If result == false 
field NOT REPORTED IN PDF
End If</xsd:documentation>
                      </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="B01c_NotApplicableMessage">
                      <xsd:annotation>
                        <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">NOT REPORTED IN PDF</xsd:documentation>
                        <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">If A04_WholeBuilding ccupancy != HighRiseResidential Or HotelMotel result = BlankGrayedOut stored in NotApplicableMessage</xsd:documentation>
                      </xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:simpleType>
                        <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                          <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                        </xsd:restriction>
                      </xsd:simpleType>
                    </xsd:element>
                  </xsd:choice>
                  <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
                    <xsd:element name="B01d_IsProjectSmartTstatPlusEE_Measure" type="comp:IsProjectSmartTstatPlusEE_Measure">
                      <xsd:annotation>
                        <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Exception to Solar Ready Area: Smart Thermostat and Alternative Energy Efficiency Measure</xsd:documentation>
                        <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The project is a multifamily occupancy where all thermostats in each dwelling unit comply with <d:t24ref h="110.12(a)"/>  AND at least one additional measure listed in Exception 4 to <d:t24ref h="110.10(b)1B"/> is installed, as documented in Table I.</xsd:documentation>
                        <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input
By default result = false and unchecked.  If user checks it, the result = true, 
 
If result == true Section I is triggered 
Else If result == false 
field NOT REPORTED IN PDF
End If</xsd:documentation>
                      </xsd:annotation>
                    </xsd:element>
                    <xsd:element name="B01d_NotApplicableMessage">
                      <xsd:annotation>
                        <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">NOT REPORTED IN PDF</xsd:documentation>
                        <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">If A04_WholeBuildingOccupancy != HighRiseResidential  result = BlankGrayedOut stored in NotApplicableMessage</xsd:documentation>
                      </xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:simpleType>
                        <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                          <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                        </xsd:restriction>
                      </xsd:simpleType>
                    </xsd:element>
                  </xsd:choice>
                  <xsd:element name="B01e_RoofTrafficSRA" type="comp:RoofTrafficSRA">
                    <xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Exception to Solar Ready Area: Roof is designed for vehicular traffic, parking or for heliport</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">Plan sheet showing roof designed for vehicular traffic, parking or heliport</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">By default result = false and unchecked.  If user checks it, the result = true
 
If result == true 
C09_DoesProjectComplySRA == ExceptionalConditionsSRA
Else If result == false 
field NOT REPORTED IN PDF
End If</xsd:documentation>
                    </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="B01e_BuildingPlanName" type="comp:BuildingPlanName" minOccurs="0">
                    <xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                      <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">If B01e_RoofTrafficSRA == true this field is required.</xsd:documentation>
                    </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="B01f_RoofTooSmallSRA" type="comp:RoofTooSmallSRA">
                    <xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Exception to Solar Ready Area: Roof too small</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The project is new construction and has a total roof area <d:lte/> 533 square feet <d:sup>1</d:sup></xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field: 
If A05_RoofConstRangeSolar == NewRoofLTE533ft2
result = true 
Else 
result = false
End If
 
If result == true 
C09_DoesProjectComplySRA == ExceptionalConditionsSRA
Else If result == false 
field NOT REPORTED IN PDF
End If</xsd:documentation>
                    </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="B01g_StoriesTooManySRA" type="comp:StoriesTooManySRA">
                    <xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Exception to Solar Ready Area: Number of building stories</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The project is nonresidential <d:gt/> 3 stories or multifamily/ hotel/motel <d:gt/> 10 stories.</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field: 
If  A06_BuildingStoryRange == StoriesGT10
If A04_WholeBuildingOccupancy == HighRiseResidential Or HotelMotel  
result = true
Else
result = false
End If
Else If A06_BuildingStoryRange == Stories4to10 Or StoriesGT10
result = true
Else 
result = false
End If
 
If result == true 
C09_DoesProjectComplySRA == ExceptionalConditionsSRA
Else If result == false 
field NOT REPORTED IN PDF
End If</xsd:documentation>
                    </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="BEndNote1" minOccurs="0">
                    <xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                      <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                        <d:i><d:sup>1</d:sup>FOOTNOTE: Buildings with roof area <d:lte/>533 ft<d:sup>2</d:sup> would have a required solar zone <d:lt/> 80 ft<d:sup>2</d:sup> and are therefore exempt per <d:t24refnolink/>110.10(b)1. </d:i>
                      </xsd:documentation>
                    </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
              </xsd:complexType>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="Bpv" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Compliance with Solar Photovoltaic (PV) and Battery Requirements in <d:t24refnolink/>140.10/ <d:t24refnolink/>170.2(g and h)</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">This subsection is required If A04_WholeBuildingOccupancy == HotelMotel, HighRiseResidential, GroceryStoreBuilding, OfficeBuilding, FinancialInstitutionBuilding, UnleasedTenantSpace, RetailBuilding, SchoolBuilding, Warehouse, LibraryBuilding, MedicalClinicBuilding, RestaurantBuilding, ReligiousFacilityBuilding, EventsExhibits, or SportsRecreation
And A05_RoofConstRangeSolar == NewRoofLTE533ft2 Or NewRoofGT533ft2
And A04_WholeBuildingOccupancy is NOT AllOthersBuildings

Or 
If A04_WholeBuildingOccupancy == AllOthersBuildings AND another A04_WholeBuildingOccupancy == HotelMotel, HighRiseResidential, GroceryStoreBuilding, OfficeBuilding, FinancialInstitutionBuilding, UnleasedTenantSpace, RetailBuilding, SchoolBuilding, Warehouse, LibraryBuilding, MedicalClinicBuilding, RestaurantBuilding, ReligiousFacilityBuilding, EventsExhibits, or SportsRecreation
And A05_RoofConstRangeSolar == NewRoofLTE533ft2 Or NewRoofGT533ft2

If this subsection is required,  one and only one field can be checked with a result == true and it is the only field that is displayed in the final report.    Fields are evaluated in the order they occur in the schema and once a field is evaluated as true and displayed as checked, remaining fields are set to unchecked, result == false and not displayed.</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
              <xsd:complexType>
                <xsd:sequence>
                  <xsd:element name="Bpv01a_SystemIncludesPV" type="comp:SystemIncludesPV">
                    <xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Provided PV system and battery storage sized per <d:t24refnolink/>140.10/ <d:t24refnolink/>170.2 (g and h)</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The project has included an installed PV system and battery storage system per requirements in <d:t24refnolink/>140.10/ <d:t24refnolink/>170.2(g and h) as documented in Table J.</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field: In Section_J 
If Pv10_PV_DesignSize GTE Pv09_PV_MinimumSize And
Bat07a_BatteryCapacity GTE Bat06a_BatteryCapacityMinTotal And
Bat07b_BatteryPower GTE Bat06a_BatteryPowerMinTotal 
result = true
Else result = false
End If</xsd:documentation>
                    </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="Bpv01b_AccessAreaTooSmall" type="comp:AccessAreaTooSmall">
                    <xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Exception to PV and Battery: Not enough Solar Access Roof Area</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The total of all available Solar Access Roof Area(s) of the project site is less than three percent of the conditioned floor area  as documented in Table J per Exception 1 to Section 140.10(a) &amp;amp; Exception 1 to Section 170.2(g)..</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field:
If Bpv01a_SystemIncludesPV == true
result = false
Else (evaluating values from J)
If SUM ALL (Pv11_SolarAccessRoofArea)  LT (0.03 x SUM ALL (Pv02_ConditionedFloorArea)) And therefore Pv09_PV_MinimumSize  == 0   
result = true
Else result = false
End If
If result == true 
BSolarReady subsection is triggered
End If</xsd:documentation>
                    </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="Bpv01c_RequiredLT4kW" type="comp:RequiredLT4kW">
                    <xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Exception to PV and Battery: Required PV <d:lt/> 4kW</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The required PV system capacity is less than 4 kW dc as documented in Table J per Exception 2 to Section 140.10(a) &amp;amp; Exception 2 to Section 170.2(g).</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field: In Section_J
If Bpv01a_SystemIncludesPV == true Or Bpv01b_AccessAreaTooSmall == true
result = false
Else (evaluating values from J) 
If (Sum All (Pv12_PV_MinSizeSARA)) or (Sum All (Pv04_PV_MinSizeEquation)) LT 4
And therefore Pv09_PV_MinimumSize  == 0 
result = true
Else result = false
End If
If result == true 
BSolarReady subsection is triggered
End If</xsd:documentation>
                    </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="Bpv01d_NoContiguousAccess" type="comp:NoContiguousAccess">
                    <xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Exception to PV and Battery: No contiguous Solar Access Roof Area</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The Solar Access Roof Area(s) of the project site contains less than 80 contiguous square feet as documented in Table J per Exception 3 to Section 140.10(a) &amp;amp; Exception 3 to Section 170.2(g).</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field: In Section_J
If Bpv01a_SystemIncludesPV == true Or Bpv01b_AccessAreaTooSmall == true Or Bpv01c_RequiredLT4kW == true
result = false
Else (evaluating values from J)
If SUM ALL (Pv11_SolarAccessRoofArea)  LT 80
And therefore Pv09_PV_MinimumSize  == 0 
result = true
Else result = false
End If
If result == true 
BSolarReady subsection is triggered
End If</xsd:documentation>
                    </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="Bpv01e_SnowloadException" type="comp:SnowloadException">
                    <xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Exception to PV and Battery: Can't meet snow load</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The project has a roof design where the enforcement authority has verified it is not possible for the PV system, including panels, modules, components, supports, and attachments to the roof structure, to meet ASCE 7-16 Chapter 7, Snow Loads per Exception 4 to Section 140.10(a) &amp;amp; Exception 4 to 170.2(g).</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input
If result == true 
BSolarReady subsection is triggered
Else If result == false 
Section_J is triggered
End If</xsd:documentation>
                    </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="Bpv0f_MultiTenantException" type="comp:MultiTenantException">
                    <xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Exception to PV and Battery: Multifamily without virtual energy credits </xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The project is a multifamily building in an area where a load serving entity does not provide a program where PV generation is compensated through virtual energy bill credits. Also, there is no community solar program and the utility does not support a virtual energy bill program per exception 5 to 170.2(g).</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">
If A04_WholeBuildingOccupancy == HighRiseResidential 
   User input
Else
   Result == false

If result == true 
   BSolarReady subsection is triggered and
   D03_ExceptionalConditionMessageCCSABE += PVBatteryExemptMF
Else If result == false 
   Section_J is triggered 
End If</xsd:documentation>
                    </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="Bpv01g_FloorAreaException" type="comp:FloorAreaException">
                    <xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Exception to PV and Battery: <d:lt/> 80% of Occupancy listed in Table 140.10-A </xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The project has a building where <d:lt/> 80% of the floor area is an occupancy in Table 140.10-A</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules"> 
If A04a_OtherFloorArea == false
   result == true and BSolarReady subsection is triggered
Else
   result == false 
End If</xsd:documentation>
                    </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
              </xsd:complexType>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="Bdhw" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Compliance with Solar Thermal Water Heating Requirements in <d:t24refnolink/>170.2(d)2Bii (Multifamiily and hotel/ motel occupancies only)</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">This subsection is required if A05_RoofConstRangeSolar != AddAltRoofLTE2000ft2 And A04_WholeBuildingOccupancy == HighRiseResidential Or HotelMotel</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
              <xsd:complexType>
                <xsd:sequence>
                  <xsd:element name="Bdhw01a_SystemIncludesSolarDHW" type="comp:SystemIncludesSolarDHW">
                    <xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                      <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The project includes a hotel/motel or multifamily occupancy with a gas or propane central water-heating system (serves 2+ dwelling units) and includes a permanently installed domestic solar water-heating system to comply with <d:t24refnolink/>170.2(d)2Bii and Reference Residential Appendix RA4, as documented in Table H. <d:line2/>Compliance meets Exception 2 to solar ready requirements in <d:t24refnolink/>110.10(b).</xsd:documentation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">result = true
If result == true Section_H is required</xsd:documentation>
                    </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
              </xsd:complexType>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="BErrorMessage_SectionErrorMessage" type="comp:SectionErrorMessage" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
          </xsd:sequence>
        </xsd:complexType>
      </xsd:element>
      <xsd:element name="Section_C" minOccurs="1">
        <xsd:annotation>
          <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">
            <d:b>C. COMPLIANCE RESULTS</d:b>
          </xsd:documentation>
          <xsd:documentation source="MinOccurs">This section is required.</xsd:documentation>
        </xsd:annotation>
        <xsd:complexType>
          <xsd:sequence>
            <xsd:element name="C_BeginNote1" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:i>Results in this table are automatically calculated from data input and calculations in Tables F through I. Note: If any cell on this table says "DOES NOT COMPLY" or "COMPLIES with Exceptional Conditions" refer to Table D. for guidance or see the applicable Table referenced below.</d:i>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="C01ToC02ColumnHeading" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">
                  <d:b>Allocated Solar Zone</d:b>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="C01ToC02TableRef" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">(See Table F)</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="C01_SolarZoneAreaRequiredMinimum" type="comp:SolarZoneAreaRequiredMinimum">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Required Minimum Area (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field: 
If B01a_IsProjectAllocatedSolarZone IsPresent And == true,  
result = F08_SolarZoneAreaRequiredMinimum; 
 
Else result = BlankGrayedOut  stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is grayed out,
End If</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="C01_NotApplicableMessage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Required Minimum Area (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field: 
If B01a_IsProjectAllocatedSolarZone NotPresent Or B01a_IsProjectAllocatedSolarZone == false  
result =  BlankGrayedOut  stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is grayed out.
End If</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:simpleType>
                  <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                    <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                  </xsd:restriction>
                </xsd:simpleType>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
            <xsd:element name="C01AfterSubheading" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:lte/>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="C02_SolarZoneSubAreasTotalSquareFootage" type="comp:SolarZoneSubAreasTotalSquareFootage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Designated Area (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated  field:  
If B01a_IsProjectAllocatedSolarZone IsPresent And == true And F08_SolarZoneAreaRequiredMinimum GT 0  
result =  FTotals18_SolarZoneSubAreasTotalSquareFootage; 
 
Else result =   BlankGrayedOut  stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is grayed out.
End If</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="C02_NotApplicableMessage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Designated Area (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated  field:  
If B01a_IsProjectAllocatedSolarZone NotPresent Or B01a_IsProjectAllocatedSolarZone == false Or F08_SolarZoneAreaRequiredMinimum == 0  
result =   BlankGrayedOut  stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is grayed out.
End If</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:simpleType>
                  <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                    <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                  </xsd:restriction>
                </xsd:simpleType>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="C02a_BuildingPlanName" type="comp:BuildingPlanName">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                  <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">Location within the construction documents showing the location for inverters and metering equipment and a pathway for the routing of conduit/plumbing to the electrical service/ water heating system per <d:t24ref h="110.10(c)"/>.</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field:  
If  B01a_IsProjectAllocatedSolarZone IsPresent And == true, 
result =  F20_BuildingPlanName; 
Else 
result =  NotApplicable display term Not Applicable stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is grayed out.
End If</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="C02a_NotApplicableMessage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field:  
If B01a_IsProjectAllocatedSolarZone NotPresent Or B01a_IsProjectAllocatedSolarZone == false
result =  NotApplicable display term Not Applicable stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is grayed out.
End If</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:appinfo source="displayterm">
                    <dtyp:displayterm value="NotApplicable">Not Applicable</dtyp:displayterm>
                  </xsd:appinfo>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:simpleType>
                  <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                    <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                  </xsd:restriction>
                </xsd:simpleType>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
            <xsd:element name="C02AfterSubheading" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">OR</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="C03ToC04ColumnHeading" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">
                  <d:b>Installed PV System</d:b>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="C03To04TableRef" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">(See Tables G or J)</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="C03_PV_SystemTotalRatedPowerDC_Minimum" type="hvac:PV_SystemTotalRatedPowerDC_Minimum">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Required Minimum DC Power Rating (Watts)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field:  
If  B01b_IsProjectInstalledPhotovoltaicSystem IsPresent And  == true,   
result = G02_PV_SystemTotalRatedPowerDC_Minimum;  
Else If Section_J IsPresent
result = Pv09_PV_MinimumSize x 1000
End If</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="C03_NotApplicableMessage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Required Minimum DC Power Rating (Watts)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field:  
If  B01b_IsProjectInstalledPhotovoltaicSystem IsPresent And == false
And Section_J NotPresent
result =  BlankGrayedOut  stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is grayed out.
End If</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:simpleType>
                  <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                    <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                  </xsd:restriction>
                </xsd:simpleType>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
            <xsd:element name="C03AfterSubheading" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:lte/>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="C04_PV_SystemTotalRatedPowerDC" type="hvac:PV_SystemTotalRatedPowerDC">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Designed DC Power Rating (Watts)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field:  
If  B01b_IsProjectInstalledPhotovoltaicSystem IsPresent And == true,  
result = G03_PV_SystemTotalRatedPowerDC;  
Else 
Else If Section_J IsPresent
result = Pv10_PV_DesignSize x 1000
End If</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="C04_NotApplicableMessage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Designed DC Power Rating (Watts)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field:  
If  B01b_IsProjectInstalledPhotovoltaicSystem IsPresent And == false,  
And Section_J NotPresent
result =  BlankGrayedOut  stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is grayed out. 
End If</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:simpleType>
                  <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                    <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                  </xsd:restriction>
                </xsd:simpleType>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
            <xsd:element name="C04AfterSubheading" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">OR</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="C05ToC06ColumnHeading" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">
                  <d:b>Installed SWH System</d:b>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="C05To06TableRef" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">(See Table H)</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="C05_SolarWaterHeatingSavingsFractionRequired" type="comp:SolarWaterHeatingSavingsFractionRequired">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Required Minimum Solar Savings Fraction</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field:  
If  Section_H IsPresent
If H00c_IsDWHR_Installed == false 
If A02_ClimateZone InRange (1,9) 
result = 0.2; 
Else If A02_ClimateZone InRange (10,16) 
result = 0.35;  
End If
 
Else If  H00c_IsDWHR_Installed == true 
If A02_ClimateZone InRange (1,9) 
result = 0.15; 
Else If A02_ClimateZone InRange (10,16) 
result = 0.30
End If
End If</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="C05_NotApplicableMessage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Required Minimum Solar Savings Fraction</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">If  Section_H NotPresent
result =  BlankGrayedOut  stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is grayed out; 
End If</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:simpleType>
                  <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                    <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                  </xsd:restriction>
                </xsd:simpleType>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
            <xsd:element name="C05AfterSubheading" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:lte/>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="C06_SolarWaterHeatingSavingsFraction" type="comp:SolarWaterHeatingSavingsFraction">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Designed/Rated Solar Savings Fraction</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field:  
If  Section_H IsPresent 
result = H03_SolarSavingsFractionOG100
End if</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="C06_NotApplicableMessage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Designed/Rated Solar Savings Fraction</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">If  Section_H NotPresent
result =  BlankGrayedOut  stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is grayed out; 
End If</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:simpleType>
                  <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                    <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                  </xsd:restriction>
                </xsd:simpleType>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
            <xsd:element name="C06AfterSubheading" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">OR</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="C07ToC08ColumnHeading" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">
                  <d:b>Smart Tstat and Alternative EE Measure</d:b>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="C07To08TableRef" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">(See Table I)</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="C07_IsOCST_RequirementSatisfied" type="comp:IsOCST_RequirementSatisfied">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">JA5 Compliant Thermostat Specified?</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field:  
If Section_I IsPresent
If I01a_IsOCST_RequirementSatisfied == true and I01b_BuildingPlanName NotNull, 
result = true, display term Yes, 
Else result = false display term No
End If</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="C07_NotApplicableMessage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">JA5 Compliant Thermostat Specified?</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">If Section_I NotPresent
result = BlankGrayedOut  stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is grayed out; 
End If</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:simpleType>
                  <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                    <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                  </xsd:restriction>
                </xsd:simpleType>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="C08_SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure" type="comp:SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure" maxOccurs="unbounded">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Alternative Energy Efficiency Measure</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field:  
If Section_I IsPresent 
If I02a_SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure And I02b_SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure And I02c_SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure And I02d_SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure And I02e_SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure == NoEfficiencyMeasure 
result = NoEfficiencyMeasure with no display term leaving the field blank
 
Else If I02f_BuildingPlanName NotNull 
If I02a_SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure == EnergyStarAppliances 
result +=  EnergyStarAppliances 
End If
If I02b_SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure == HomeAutomationDemandResponseCapable  
result +=  HomeAutomationDemandResponseCapable 
End If
If I02c_SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure == AlternativePlumbingForGrayWaterIrrigation  
result +=   AlternativePlumbingForGrayWaterIrrigation
End If
If  I02d_SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure == RainwaterCatchmentSystem  
result +=  RainwaterCatchmentSystem 
End If
If  I02e_SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure == ChargingSpaceForEV  
result +=  ChargingSpaceForEV  
End If
End If</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:appinfo source="displayterm">
                    <dtyp:displayterm value="EnergyStarAppliances">Energy Star Appliances and EC Motor</dtyp:displayterm>
                    <dtyp:displayterm value="HomeAutomationDemandResponseCapable">Home Automation System</dtyp:displayterm>
                    <dtyp:displayterm value="AlternativePlumbingForGrayWaterIrrigation">Greywater Irrigation System</dtyp:displayterm>
                    <dtyp:displayterm value="RainwaterCatchmentSystem">Rainwater Catchment System</dtyp:displayterm>
                    <dtyp:displayterm value="ChargingSpaceForEV">Part 11: Electric Vehicle Charging</dtyp:displayterm>
                  </xsd:appinfo>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="C08_NotApplicableMessage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Alternative Energy Efficiency Measure</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">If Section_I NotPresent
result = BlankGrayedOut  stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is grayed out; 
End If</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:simpleType>
                  <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                    <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                  </xsd:restriction>
                </xsd:simpleType>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
            <xsd:element name="C09_DoesProjectComplySRA" type="comp:DoesProjectComplySRA">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">
                  <d:b>Compliance Results</d:b>
                </xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field:  
If C01_SolarZoneAreaRequiredMinimum IsPresent then  
If  C02_SolarZoneSubAreasTotalSquareFootage GTE C01_SolarZoneAreaRequiredMinimum And all values in F19_DoesSolarZoneSubAreaQualify = true, 
result = CompliantSRA display term COMPLIES; 
 
Else If C01_SolarZoneAreaRequiredMinimum == 0 And C02_NotApplicableMessage == NotApplicable  
result = CompliantSRA display term COMPLIES; 
Else result = NotCompliantSRA display term DOES NOT COMPLY;  
End If
Else If C01_NotApplicableMessage IsPresent
Continue evaluation
 
If C03_PV_SystemTotalRatedPowerDC_Minimum IsPresent then 
If C04_PV_SystemTotalRatedPowerDC  GTE C03_PV_SystemTotalRatedPowerDC_Minimum 
result = CompliantSRA display term COMPLIES; 
Else result = NotCompliantSRA display term DOES NOT COMPLY;   
End if
Else If C03_NotApplicableMessage IsPresent
Continue evaluation
 
If C05_SolarWaterHeatingSavingsFractionRequired IsPresent then 
If C06_SolarWaterHeatingSavingsFraction GTE C05_SolarWaterHeatingSavingsFractionRequired 
result = CompliantSRA display term COMPLIES; 
Else result = NotCompliantSRA display term DOES NOT COMPLY;   
End If
Else If C05_NotApplicableMessage IsPresent
Continue evaluation
 
If C07_IsOCST_RequirementSatisfied IsPresent then 
If C07_IsOCST_RequirementSatisfied == true And C08_SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure NotNull And C08_SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure != NoEfficiencyMeasure,  then 
result = CompliantSRA display term COMPLIES; 
Else result = NotCompliantSRA display term DOES NOT COMPLY
End If
Else If C07_NotApplicableMessage IsPresent
Continue evaluation
 
If B01e_RoofTrafficSRA == true Or B01f_RoofTooSmallSRA == true Or B01g_StoriesTooManySRA == true
result = ExceptionalConditionsSRA display term COMPLIES with Exceptional Conditions
Else result = NotCompliantSRA display term DOES NOT COMPLY;
End If
End If</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="C09a_SolarZoneConnectionsDocCompliance" type="comp:SolarZoneConnectionsDocCompliance">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field:  
If  B01a_IsProjectAllocatedSolarZone == false then 
result = NotApplicable stored in C09a_NotApplicableMessage;  
 
Else If C02a_BuildingPlanName NotNull, then 
result = Complies display term COMPLIES; 
Else result = DoesNotComply display term DOES NOT COMPLY
End If</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="C09a_NotApplicableMessage" type="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">If  B01a_IsProjectAllocatedSolarZone == false then 
result = NotApplicable display term Not Applicable 
End If</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:appinfo source="displayterm">
                    <dtyp:displayterm value="NotApplicable">Not Applicable</dtyp:displayterm>
                  </xsd:appinfo>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="C09b_DoesProjectComplyBattery" type="comp:DoesProjectComplyBattery">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                  <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">Battery storage system design meets the minimum requirements in Joint Appendix JA12 and the minimum energy (kWh)/  power (kW) capacity per Table J.</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field: 
If Section_J IsPresent 
If  TableBat IsPresent
If Bat07a_BatteryCapacity  GTE Bat06a_BatteryCapacityMinTotal And 
Bat07b_BatteryPower  GTE Bat06b_BatteryPowerMinTotal 
result = CompliantBat display term COMPLIES
Else
result = NotCompiantBat display term DOES NOT COMPLY
End If
Else If TableBat NotPresent
result = NotApplicableBat display term Not Applicable
End If
End If</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="C09b_NotApplicableMessage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field: 
If Section_J NotPresent  
result = BlankGrayedOut
End If</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:simpleType>
                  <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                    <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                  </xsd:restriction>
                </xsd:simpleType>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
          </xsd:sequence>
        </xsd:complexType>
      </xsd:element>
      <xsd:element name="Section_D" minOccurs="1">
        <xsd:annotation>
          <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">
            <d:b>D. EXCEPTIONAL CONDITIONS</d:b>
          </xsd:documentation>
          <xsd:documentation source="MinOccurs">This section is required.</xsd:documentation>
        </xsd:annotation>
        <xsd:complexType>
          <xsd:sequence>
            <xsd:element name="D_BeginNote1" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:i>This table is auto-filled with uneditable comments because of selections made or data entered in tables throughout the form.</d:i>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="TableAllExceptionalConditions" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
              </xsd:annotation>
              <xsd:complexType>
                <xsd:sequence>
                  <xsd:element name="Row" minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="unbounded">
                    <xsd:complexType>
                      <xsd:sequence>
                        <xsd:element name="D01_SectionExceptionalConditionNotes" type="comp:SectionExceptionalConditionNotes">
                          <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                            <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">This combines all the strings stored in ExceptionalConditionNote for sections that have exceptional conditions</xsd:documentation>
                          </xsd:annotation>
                        </xsd:element>
                        <xsd:element name="D02_AllSectionsErrorMessages" type="comp:AllSectionsErrorMessages" maxOccurs="unbounded">
                          <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                            <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">This combines all the strings stored in SectionErrorMessage  for sections that have errors</xsd:documentation>
                          </xsd:annotation>
                        </xsd:element>
                      </xsd:sequence>
                    </xsd:complexType>
                  </xsd:element>
                </xsd:sequence>
              </xsd:complexType>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="D03_ExceptionalConditionMessageCCSABE" type="comp:ExceptionalConditionMessageCCSABE" minOccurs="0" maxOccurs="unbounded">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Exceptional Messages</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Auto-filled with any system generated messages that explain exceptional conditions encountered in the the completed compliance document</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
          </xsd:sequence>
        </xsd:complexType>
      </xsd:element>
      <xsd:element name="Section_E" minOccurs="0">
        <xsd:annotation>
          <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">
            <d:b>E. ADDITIONAL REMARKS</d:b>
          </xsd:documentation>
          <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">This section is required if there are  comments from the permit applicant to the Authority Having Jurisdiction</xsd:documentation>
          <xsd:documentation source="MinOccurs">If this section doesn't apply, do not display anything for this section</xsd:documentation>
        </xsd:annotation>
        <xsd:complexType>
          <xsd:sequence>
            <xsd:element name="E_BeginNote1" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:i>This table is includes remarks made by the permit applicant to the Authority Having Jurisdiction.</d:i>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="E01_CommentsToPermitAuthority" type="comp:CommentsToPermitAuthority" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
          </xsd:sequence>
        </xsd:complexType>
      </xsd:element>
      <xsd:element name="Section_F" minOccurs="0">
        <xsd:annotation>
          <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">
            <d:b>F. ALLOCATED SOLAR ZONE</d:b>
          </xsd:documentation>
          <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Section F is required if B01a_IsProjectAllocatedSolarZone == true And A05_RoofConstRangeSolar != AddAltRoofLTE2000ft2</xsd:documentation>
          <xsd:documentation source="MinOccurs">If this section doesn't apply, do not display anything for this section</xsd:documentation>
        </xsd:annotation>
        <xsd:complexType>
          <xsd:sequence>
            <xsd:element name="F_BeginNote1" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:i>This table is completed if the project is designating a solar zone to comply with <d:t24ref h="110.10(b)1B"/>. New construction consider the total roof area; Additions consider newly added roof area.  This table demonstrates that the project has designated the minimum area required for the Allocated Solar Zone, and also that the requirements for Solar Zone Subareas have been met.  Each subarea must be shown on a roof plan or documented in construction documents.  The solar zones must also comply with fire code requirements, including, but not limited to, setback and pathway requirements.  Requirements for interconnection pathways must also be included in construction documents, and the location is specified in this table. </d:i>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="F01To08ColumnHeading" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:b>Required Minimum Solar Zone</d:b>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="F01_SolarZoneAreaCalculationMethod" type="comp:SolarZoneAreaCalculationMethod">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Minimum Solar Zone Area Calculation Method</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User selects from dropdown list: PotentialSolarZoneMethod display term Potential Solar Zone, RoofNewAddedAreaMethod display term Total New of Added Roof area</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="F02_RoofAreaNewOrAdded" type="comp:RoofAreaNewOrAdded">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Total New or Added Roof Area (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="F03_SkylightAreaRoofNewOrAdded" type="comp:SkylightAreaRoofNewOrAdded">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Total New or Added Roof Area Covered with Skylights (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input required if F01_SolarZoneAreaCalculationMethodNR == RoofNewAddedAreaMethod; Else NotApplicable stored in F03_NotApplicableMessage and field is grayed out.</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="F03_NotApplicableMessage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Total New or Added Roof Area Covered with Skylights (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input required if F01_SolarZoneAreaCalculationMethodNR == RoofNewAddedAreaMethod; Else NotApplicable stored in F03_NotApplicableMessage and field is grayed out.</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:simpleType>
                  <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                    <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                  </xsd:restriction>
                </xsd:simpleType>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="F04_SolarZoneAreaNetRoofAreaMethod" type="comp:SolarZoneAreaNetRoofAreaMethod">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Minimum Solar Zone Based on Total or Added Roof Area (0.15 x (Roof-Skylt)) (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field: If F01_SolarZoneAreaCalculationMethodNR == RoofNewAddedAreaMethod  result = PRODUCT (0.15, (F02_RoofAreaNewOrAdded -  F03_SkylightAreaRoofNewOrAdded));  Else result = NotApplicable stored in F04_NotApplicableMessage and field is grayed out;</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="F04_NotApplicableMessage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Minimum Solar Zone Based on Total or Added Roof Area (0.15 x (Roof-Skylt)) (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field: If F01_SolarZoneAreaCalculationMethodNR == RoofNewAddedAreaMethod  result = PRODUCT (0.15, (F02_RoofAreaNewOrAdded -  F03_SkylightAreaRoofNewOrAdded));  Else result = NotApplicable stored in F04_NotApplicableMessage and field is grayed out;</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:simpleType>
                  <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                    <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                  </xsd:restriction>
                </xsd:simpleType>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="F05_SolarAccessMethodDescription" type="comp:SolarAccessMethodDescription">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Method/ Tools Used to Determine Annual Solar Access for Potential Zones<d:sup>1</d:sup></xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input required If F01_SolarZoneAreaCalculationMethodNR == PotentialSolarZoneMethod; Else result =  BlankGrayedOut stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is blank and grayed out.</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="F05_NotApplicableMessage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Method/ Tools Used to Determine Annual Solar Access for Potential Zones<d:sup>1</d:sup></xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input required If F01_SolarZoneAreaCalculationMethodNR == PotentialSolarZoneMethod; Else result =  BlankGrayedOut stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is blank and grayed out.</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:simpleType>
                  <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                    <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                  </xsd:restriction>
                </xsd:simpleType>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
            <xsd:element name="F06aToF06cColumnHeading" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">Potential Solar Zone Areas: Roof areas with <d:gte/> 70% Solar Access</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="F06a_RoofAreaLowSlope70PercentSolarAccess" type="comp:RoofAreaLowSlope70PercentSolarAccess">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Low-Sloped Area (<d:lte/> 2:12 pitch) (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input required If F01_SolarZoneAreaCalculationMethodNR == PotentialSolarZoneMethod; Else result = BlankGrayedOut stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is blank and grayed out.</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="F06a_NotApplicableMessage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Low-Sloped Area (<d:lte/> 2:12 pitch) (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input required If F01_SolarZoneAreaCalculationMethodNR == PotentialSolarZoneMethod; Else result =BlankGrayedOut stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is blank and grayed out.</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:simpleType>
                  <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                    <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                  </xsd:restriction>
                </xsd:simpleType>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="F06b_RoofAreaSteepSlope70PercentSolarAccess" type="comp:RoofAreaSteepSlope70PercentSolarAccess">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Steep-Sloped Area (<d:gt/> 2:12 pitch) Oriented 90<d:deg/> - 300 <d:deg/> (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input required If F01_SolarZoneAreaCalculationMethodNR == PotentialSolarZoneMethod; Else result = BlankGrayedOut stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is blank and grayed out.</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="F06b_NotApplicableMessage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Steep-Sloped Area (<d:gt/> 2:12 pitch) Oriented 90<d:deg/> - 300 <d:deg/> (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input required If F01_SolarZoneAreaCalculationMethodNR == PotentialSolarZoneMethod; Else result = BlankGrayedOut stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is blank and grayed out.</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:simpleType>
                  <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                    <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                  </xsd:restriction>
                </xsd:simpleType>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="F06c_SolarZoneAreaPotential" type="comp:SolarZoneAreaPotential">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Total Potential Solar Zone Area (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field: If F01_SolarZoneAreaCalculationMethodNR == PotentialSolarZoneMethod  result = SUM (F06a_RoofAreaLowSlope70PercentSolarAccess, F06b_RoofAreaSteepSlope70PercentSolarAccess); Else result = BlankGrayedOut stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is blank and grayed out.</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="F06c_NotApplicableMessage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Total Potential Solar Zone Area (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field: If F01_SolarZoneAreaCalculationMethodNR == PotentialSolarZoneMethod  result = SUM (F06a_RoofAreaLowSlope70PercentSolarAccess, F06b_RoofAreaSteepSlope70PercentSolarAccess); Else result = BlankGrayedOut stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is blank and grayed out.</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:simpleType>
                  <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                    <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                  </xsd:restriction>
                </xsd:simpleType>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="F07_SolarZoneAreaSolarAccessMethod" type="comp:SolarZoneAreaSolarAccessMethod">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Minimum Solar Zone Based on Potential Zone (0.5 x (Total Potential Zone)) (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field: If F01_SolarZoneAreaCalculationMethodNR == PotentialSolarZoneMethod result = PRODUCT (0.5, F06c_SolarZoneAreaPotential); Else result = BlankGrayedOut stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is blank and grayed out.</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="F07_NotApplicableMessage">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Minimum Solar Zone Based on Potential Zone (0.5 x (Total Potential Zone)) (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated field: If F01_SolarZoneAreaCalculationMethodNR == PotentialSolarZoneMethod result = PRODUCT (0.5, F06c_SolarZoneAreaPotential); Else result = BlankGrayedOut stored in NotApplicableMessage and field is blank and grayed out.</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:simpleType>
                  <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                    <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                  </xsd:restriction>
                </xsd:simpleType>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
            <xsd:element name="F08_SolarZoneAreaRequiredMinimum" type="comp:SolarZoneAreaRequiredMinimum">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Required Minimum Solar Zone Area (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated value:  If F01_SolarZoneAreaCalculationMethodNR == RoofNewAddedAreaMethod result = F04_SolarZoneAreaNetRoofAreaMethod Else result = F07_ SolarZoneAreaSolarAccessMethod</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="F09To19ColumnHeading" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:b> Designated Solar Zone Subareas </d:b>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="ChoiceSubAreas">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
              </xsd:annotation>
              <xsd:complexType>
                <xsd:choice>
                  <xsd:element name="F09to19NA_NotApplicableMessage">
                    <xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                      <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">If F08_SolarZoneAreaRequiredMinimum == 0 result = BlankGrayedOut for this subsection.  No data is required for F09 - F19 and the fields are blank and grayed out</xsd:documentation>
                    </xsd:annotation>
                    <xsd:simpleType>
                      <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                        <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                      </xsd:restriction>
                    </xsd:simpleType>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="SubAreas">
                    <xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                      <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">If F08_SolarZoneAreaRequiredMinimum GT 0 data on solar Zone Subareas is required.</xsd:documentation>
                    </xsd:annotation>
                    <xsd:complexType>
                      <xsd:sequence>
                        <xsd:element name="TableSubArea">
                          <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                          </xsd:annotation>
                          <xsd:complexType>
                            <xsd:sequence>
                              <xsd:element name="Row" minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="unbounded">
                                <xsd:complexType>
                                  <xsd:sequence>
                                    <xsd:element name="F09_SolarZoneSubAreaID" type="comp:SolarZoneSubAreaID">
                                      <xsd:annotation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Subarea Name or Tag</xsd:documentation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input</xsd:documentation>
                                      </xsd:annotation>
                                    </xsd:element>
                                    <xsd:element name="F10_BuildingPlanName" type="comp:BuildingPlanName">
                                      <xsd:annotation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Building Plan Reference</xsd:documentation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input</xsd:documentation>
                                      </xsd:annotation>
                                    </xsd:element>
                                    <xsd:element name="F11_RoofSlope">
                                      <xsd:annotation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Roof or Overhang Slope (Low <d:lte/> 2:12 pitch) (Steep <d:gt/> 2:12 pitch)</xsd:documentation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User selects from list: LowSlope  
 SteepSlope</xsd:documentation>
                                        <xsd:appinfo source="displayterm">
                                          <dtyp:displayterm value="LowSlope"> Low-sloped</dtyp:displayterm>
                                          <dtyp:displayterm value="SteepSlope"> Steep-sloped</dtyp:displayterm>
                                        </xsd:appinfo>
                                      </xsd:annotation>
                                      <xsd:simpleType>
                                        <xsd:restriction base="env:RoofSlope">
                                          <xsd:enumeration value="LowSlope"/>
                                          <xsd:enumeration value="SteepSlope"/>
                                        </xsd:restriction>
                                      </xsd:simpleType>
                                    </xsd:element>
                                    <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
                                      <xsd:element name="F12_IsSolarZoneSubAreaSteepSlopeAzimuthCompliant" type="comp:IsSolarZoneSubAreaSteepSlopeAzimuthCompliant">
                                        <xsd:annotation>
                                          <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Is Steep-Sloped Roof or Overhang between 90 and 300 degrees?</xsd:documentation>
                                          <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">If F11_RoofSlope != SteepSlope result = NotApplicable stored in F12_NotApplicableMessage; Else User input.   If user selects Yes, result = true, else If user selects No result = false
 
Mandatory Measure Triggers:
If result == true
MM110_10b2_MeasureApplies  = true and is displayed
End If</xsd:documentation>
                                        </xsd:annotation>
                                      </xsd:element>
                                      <xsd:element name="F12_NotApplicableMessage">
                                        <xsd:annotation>
                                          <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Is Steep-Sloped Roof or Overhang between 90 and 300 degrees?</xsd:documentation>
                                          <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">If F11_RoofSlope != SteepSlope result = NotApplicable stored in F12_NotApplicableMessage; Else User input.   If user selects Yes, result = true, else If user selects No result = false</xsd:documentation>
                                        </xsd:annotation>
                                        <xsd:simpleType>
                                          <xsd:restriction base="comp:NotApplicableMessage">
                                            <xsd:enumeration value="BlankGrayedOut"/>
                                          </xsd:restriction>
                                        </xsd:simpleType>
                                      </xsd:element>
                                    </xsd:choice>
                                    <xsd:element name="F13_IsSolarZoneSubAreaT24Part9Compliant" type="comp:IsSolarZoneSubAreaT24Part9Compliant">
                                      <xsd:annotation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Subarea Complies with Title 24, Part 9</xsd:documentation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input.  If user selects Yes, result = true, else If user selects No result = false</xsd:documentation>
                                      </xsd:annotation>
                                    </xsd:element>
                                    <xsd:element name="F14_IsSolarZoneSubAreaObstructionsFree" type="comp:IsSolarZoneSubAreaObstructionsFree">
                                      <xsd:annotation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Solar Zone Subarea Free of Obstructions per <d:t24ref h="110.10(b)3A"/></xsd:documentation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input.  If user selects Yes, result = true, else If user selects No result = false
 
Mandatory Measure Triggers:
If result == true
MM110_10b3_MeasureApplies  = true and is displayed
End If</xsd:documentation>
                                      </xsd:annotation>
                                    </xsd:element>
                                    <xsd:element name="F15_IsSolarZoneSubAreaDistantFromObstructions" type="comp:IsSolarZoneSubAreaDistantFromObstructions">
                                      <xsd:annotation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Subarea is Required Distance from Potential Obstructions per <d:t24ref h="110.10(b)3B"/></xsd:documentation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input.  If user selects Yes, result = true, else If user selects No result = false
 
Mandatory Measure Triggers:
If result == true
MM110_10b3_MeasureApplies  = true and is displayed
End If</xsd:documentation>
                                      </xsd:annotation>
                                    </xsd:element>
                                    <xsd:element name="F16_IsSolarZoneSubAreaSmallDimension5ftPlus" type="comp:IsSolarZoneSubAreaSmallDimension5ftPlus">
                                      <xsd:annotation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Is the Smallest Dimension 5 feet or greater?</xsd:documentation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input.  If user selects Yes, result = true, else If user selects No result = false</xsd:documentation>
                                      </xsd:annotation>
                                    </xsd:element>
                                    <xsd:element name="F17_SolarZoneSubAreaSizeRequiredMinimum" type="comp:SolarZoneSubAreaSizeRequiredMinimum">
                                      <xsd:annotation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Min. Area Required per Subarea (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated value: If F02_RoofAreaNewOrAdded LTE 10,000 ft2 result = 80 ft2; Else result = 160 ft2</xsd:documentation>
                                      </xsd:annotation>
                                    </xsd:element>
                                    <xsd:element name="F18_SolarZoneSubAreaSquareFootage" type="comp:SolarZoneSubAreaSquareFootage">
                                      <xsd:annotation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Designated Area (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input</xsd:documentation>
                                      </xsd:annotation>
                                    </xsd:element>
                                    <xsd:element name="F19_DoesSolarZoneSubAreaQualify" type="comp:DoesSolarZoneSubAreaQualify">
                                      <xsd:annotation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Subarea Complies?</xsd:documentation>
                                        <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated value: If F12_IsSolarZoneSubAreaSteepSlopeAzimuthCompliant == true Or F12_NotApplicableMessage == NotApplicable, And If F13_IsSolarZoneSubAreaT24Part9Compliant ==true And F14_ IsSolarZoneSubAreaObstructionsFree
 ==true And F15_ IsSolarZoneSubAreaDistantFromObstructions==true And F16_ IsSolarZoneSubAreaSmallDimension5ftPlus == true And F18_SolarZoneSubAreaSquareFootage GTE F17_SolarZoneSubAreaSizeRequiredMinimum Then result = true display term COMPLIES Else result = false display term  DOES NOT COMPLY and D03_ExceptionalConditionMessageCCSABE += SubAreaComplianceInF</xsd:documentation>
                                        <xsd:appinfo source="displayterm">
                                          <dtyp:displayterm value="true">COMPLIES</dtyp:displayterm>
                                          <dtyp:displayterm value="false">DOES NOT COMPLY</dtyp:displayterm>
                                        </xsd:appinfo>
                                      </xsd:annotation>
                                    </xsd:element>
                                  </xsd:sequence>
                                </xsd:complexType>
                              </xsd:element>
                            </xsd:sequence>
                          </xsd:complexType>
                        </xsd:element>
                        <xsd:element name="FTotals18_SolarZoneSubAreasTotalSquareFootage" type="comp:SolarZoneSubAreasTotalSquareFootage" minOccurs="0">
                          <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">
                              <d:b>Total Designated Solar Zone Area (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>):</d:b>
                            </xsd:documentation>
                            <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">If F08_SolarZoneAreaRequiredMinimum GT 0 result = SUM All (F18_SolarZoneSubAreaSquareFootage   where F19_DoesSolarZoneSubAreaQualify == true ) Else no data required and in display field is grayed out</xsd:documentation>
                          </xsd:annotation>
                        </xsd:element>
                      </xsd:sequence>
                    </xsd:complexType>
                  </xsd:element>
                </xsd:choice>
              </xsd:complexType>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="F20_BuildingPlanName" type="comp:BuildingPlanName">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">
                  <d:b>Interconnection Pathways</d:b>
                </xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">Location in construction documents showing the location for inverters and metering equipment and a pathway for the routing of conduit/ plumbing to the electrical service/ water heating system per <d:t24ref h="110.10(c)"/>.</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input
 
Mandatory Measure Triggers:
If result == true
MM110_10c_MeasureApplies  = true and is displayed And
MM110_10d_MeasureApplies  = true and is displayed And 
 MM110_10e_MeasureApplies  = true and is displayed And 
End If</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="FEndNote1" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements"><d:sup>1</d:sup>FOOTNOTE:  This field is used to document how the percentage of annual solar access was determined per <d:t24ref h="110.10(b)1B"/>.  Solar access is the ratio of solar insolation including shade to the solar insolation without shade.  Shading from obstructions located on the roof or any other part of the building shall not be included in the determination of annual solar access.</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="FErrorMessage_SectionErrorMessage" type="comp:SectionErrorMessage" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
          </xsd:sequence>
        </xsd:complexType>
      </xsd:element>
      <xsd:element name="Section_G" minOccurs="0">
        <xsd:annotation>
          <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">
            <d:b>G. PERMANENTLY INSTALLED SOLAR PV FOR SOLAR READY EXCEPTION</d:b>
          </xsd:documentation>
          <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Section G is required if B01b_IsProjectInstalledPhotovoltaicSystem == true</xsd:documentation>
          <xsd:documentation source="MinOccurs">If this section doesn't apply, do not display anything for this section</xsd:documentation>
        </xsd:annotation>
        <xsd:complexType>
          <xsd:sequence>
            <xsd:element name="G_BeginNote1" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:i>This table is completed if the project is installing a PV system to comply with <d:t24ref h="110.10(b)1B"/> Exception 1. </d:i>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="G01_RoofAreaNewOrAdded" type="comp:RoofAreaNewOrAdded">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Total Roof Area<d:sup>1</d:sup> (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="G02_PV_SystemTotalRatedPowerDC_Minimum" type="hvac:PV_SystemTotalRatedPowerDC_Minimum">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Required Minimum DC Power Rating (Watts)</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Calculated value: result = G01_RoofAreaNewOrAdded  because requirement is 1 Watt per 1 square foot of roof area</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="G03_PV_SystemTotalRatedPowerDC" type="hvac:PV_SystemTotalRatedPowerDC">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Designed System DC Power Rating (Watts)</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="G04_BuildingPlanName" type="comp:BuildingPlanName">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Location in Construction Documents showing PV System/ Components</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User  input</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="G05_VerifedByInspector" type="comp:VerifedByInspector" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Field Inspector</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">This field is displayed as  Pass checkbox and a Fail checkbox in printed form that is given to the Field Inspector.  It is currently not part of the stored XML data</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="GEndNote1" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:i><d:sup>1</d:sup> FOOTNOTES: Newly Constructed Projects should report total roof areas; Additions should report newly added roof area.</d:i>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="GErrorMessage_SectionErrorMessage" type="comp:SectionErrorMessage" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
          </xsd:sequence>
        </xsd:complexType>
      </xsd:element>
      <xsd:element name="Section_H" minOccurs="0">
        <xsd:annotation>
          <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">
            <d:b>H. PERMANENTLY INSTALLED SOLAR HOT WATER SYSTEMS </d:b>
          </xsd:documentation>
          <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Section H is required if B01c_IsProjectInstalledSolarWaterHeating ==true Or If Bdhw01a_SystemIncludesSolarDHW == true</xsd:documentation>
          <xsd:documentation source="MinOccurs">If this section doesn't apply, do not display anything for this section</xsd:documentation>
        </xsd:annotation>
        <xsd:complexType>
          <xsd:sequence>
            <xsd:element name="H_BeginNote1" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:i>This table is completed if the project is installing a solar water heating (SWH) system to comply with <d:t24refnolink/>110.10(b)1B Exception 2 or for multifamily/ hotel/motel occupancies to demonstrate compliance with <d:t24refnolink/>170.2(d)2Bii. </d:i>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="H00a" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">OG-100 Certified Collectors</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The SWH system is built-up and specifies collectors certified by the Solar Rating &amp;amp; Certification Company (SRCC) or the International Association of Plumbing &amp;amp; Mechanical Officials (IAPMO) as OG-100</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="H00c_IsDWHR_Installed" type="comp:IsDWHR_Installed">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Drain Water Heat Recovery</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">A drain water heat recovery system that is field verified by a HERS Rater as specified in the Reference Appendix RA3.6.9 is being used to lower the required Solar Savings Fraction per <d:t24refnolink/>170.2(d)2Bii.</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input.  If checked result = true; Else result = false</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="H01_SolarWaterHeatingCertificationAuthority" type="comp:SolarWaterHeatingCertificationAuthority">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">SRCC# or IAPMO File #</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User selects from list: IAPMOfile#, 
 SRCC#</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:choice maxOccurs="1">
              <xsd:element name="H02_SolarWaterSystemSRCC_CertificationNumber" type="hvac:SolarWaterSystemSRCC_CertificationNumber">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Certification #</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input; If H01_SolarWaterHeatingCertificationAuthority ==SRCC# user input is assigned to H02_SolarWaterSystemSRCC_CertificationNumber</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
              <xsd:element name="H02_SolarWaterSystemIAPMO_FileNumber" type="hvac:SolarWaterSystemIAPMO_FileNumber">
                <xsd:annotation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Certification #</xsd:documentation>
                  <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input; If H01_SolarWaterHeatingCertificationAuthority ==IAPMOfile# user input is assigned to H02_SolarWaterSystemIAPMO_FileNumber</xsd:documentation>
                </xsd:annotation>
              </xsd:element>
            </xsd:choice>
            <xsd:element name="H03_SolarSavingsFractionOG100" type="comp:SolarSavingsFractionOG100">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Designed Solar Savings Fraction for OG-100</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="H04_IsT24SWHCalculatorOutputAttached" type="comp:IsT24SWHCalculatorOutputAttached">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Output from CEC's T24 SWH Calculator Attached<d:sup>1</d:sup></xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input  If user selects Yes result = true
If result == false
D03_ExceptionalConditionMessageCCSABE += CalculatorOutputAttachedForH</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="H06_VerifedByInspector" type="comp:VerifedByInspector" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Field Inspector</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">This field is displayed as  Pass checkbox and a Fail checkbox in printed form that is given to the Field Inspector.  It is currently not part of the stored XML data</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="HEndNote1" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:i><d:sup>1</d:sup>FOOTNOTES: Built-up SWH systems using OG-100 collectors must calculate the Designed Solar Savings Fraction using the SWH module in the CEC's CBECC software.  The calculation output must be included within the permit application. </d:i>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="HErrorMessage_SectionErrorMessage" type="comp:SectionErrorMessage" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
          </xsd:sequence>
        </xsd:complexType>
      </xsd:element>
      <xsd:element name="Section_I" minOccurs="0">
        <xsd:annotation>
          <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">
            <d:b>I. SMART THERMOSTATS AND ALTERNATIVE EFFICIENCY MEASURE FOR SOLAR READY EXCEPTION</d:b>
          </xsd:documentation>
          <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Section I is required if B01d_IsProjectSmartTstatPlusEE_Measure == true</xsd:documentation>
          <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">Only 1 I02 element should be != NoEfficiencyMeasure</xsd:documentation>
          <xsd:documentation source="MinOccurs">If this section doesn't apply, do not display anything for this section</xsd:documentation>
        </xsd:annotation>
        <xsd:complexType>
          <xsd:sequence>
            <xsd:element name="I_BeginNote1" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:i>  This table indicates thermostats compliant with <d:t24refnolink/>110.12(a) have been specified and which additional energy efficiency measure has been included in the design for multifamily occupancies complying with Exception 4 to <d:t24refnolink/>110.10(b)1B .</d:i>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="I01ColumnHeading" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:b>Smart Thermostats</d:b>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="I01a_IsOCST_RequirementSatisfied" type="comp:IsOCST_RequirementSatisfied">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The contract documents clearly specify that all thermostats in each dwelling unit comply with <d:t24refnolink/>110.12(a) prior to granting of an occupancy permit by the enforcing agency.</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input.  If checked result = true; Else result = false</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="I01b_BuildingPlanName" type="comp:BuildingPlanName">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Location in contract documents:</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="I02ColumnHeading" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:b>Alternative Efficiency Measure</d:b>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="I02ColumnSubheading" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">In addition, my project includes:</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="I02a_SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Energy Star Appliances and EC Motor</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The contract documents include an ENERGY STAR dishwasher AND EITHER an ENERGY STAR refrigerator OR a whole house fan driven by an electronically commutated motor</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input; If unchecked result = NoEfficiencyMeasure, Else result =  EnergyStarAppliances</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:appinfo source="displayterm">
                  <dtyp:displayterm value="EnergyStarAppliances">Energy Star Appliances and EC Motor
</dtyp:displayterm>
                </xsd:appinfo>
              </xsd:annotation>
              <xsd:simpleType>
                <xsd:restriction base="comp:SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure">
                  <xsd:enumeration value="EnergyStarAppliances"/>
                  <xsd:enumeration value="NoEfficiencyMeasure"/>
                </xsd:restriction>
              </xsd:simpleType>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="I02b_SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Home Automation System</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The contract documents include a home automation system that is capable of, at a minimum, controlling the appliances and lighting of the dwelling and responding to demand response signals.</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input; If unchecked result = NoEfficiencyMeasure, Else result =  HomeAutomationDemandResponseCapable</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:appinfo source="displayterm">
                  <dtyp:displayterm value="HomeAutomationDemandResponseCapable">Home Automation System</dtyp:displayterm>
                </xsd:appinfo>
              </xsd:annotation>
              <xsd:simpleType>
                <xsd:restriction base="comp:SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure">
                  <xsd:enumeration value="HomeAutomationDemandResponseCapable"/>
                  <xsd:enumeration value="NoEfficiencyMeasure"/>
                </xsd:restriction>
              </xsd:simpleType>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="I02c_SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Greywater Irrigation System</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The contract documents include alternative plumbing piping to permit the discharge from the clothes washer and all showers and bathtubs to be used for an irrigation system in compliance with the California Plumbing Code and any applicable local ordinances.</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input; If unchecked result = NoEfficiencyMeasure, Else result =  AlternativePlumbingForGrayWaterIrrigation</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:appinfo source="displayterm">
                  <dtyp:displayterm value="AlternativePlumbingForGrayWaterIrrigation">Greywater Irrigation System</dtyp:displayterm>
                </xsd:appinfo>
              </xsd:annotation>
              <xsd:simpleType>
                <xsd:restriction base="comp:SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure">
                  <xsd:enumeration value="AlternativePlumbingForGrayWaterIrrigation"/>
                  <xsd:enumeration value="NoEfficiencyMeasure"/>
                </xsd:restriction>
              </xsd:simpleType>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="I02d_SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Rainwater Catchment System</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The contract documents include a rainwater catchment system designed to comply with the California Plumbing Code and any applicable local ordinances, and that uses rainwater flowing from at least 65% of the available roof area.</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input; If unchecked result = NoEfficiencyMeasure, Else result =  RainwaterCatchmentSystem</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:appinfo source="displayterm">
                  <dtyp:displayterm value="RainwaterCatchmentSystem">Rainwater Catchment System</dtyp:displayterm>
                </xsd:appinfo>
              </xsd:annotation>
              <xsd:simpleType>
                <xsd:restriction base="comp:SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure">
                  <xsd:enumeration value="NoEfficiencyMeasure"/>
                  <xsd:enumeration value="RainwaterCatchmentSystem"/>
                </xsd:restriction>
              </xsd:simpleType>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="I02e_SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Part 11: Electric Vehicle Charging</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">The contract documents demonstrate compliance with Title 24, Part 11 <d:t24refnolink/>A4.106.8.2 requirements for electric vehicle charging spaces.</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input; If unchecked result = NoEfficiencyMeasure, Else result =  ChargingSpaceForEV</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:appinfo source="displayterm">
                  <dtyp:displayterm value="ChargingSpaceForEV">Part 11: Electric Vehicle Charging</dtyp:displayterm>
                </xsd:appinfo>
              </xsd:annotation>
              <xsd:simpleType>
                <xsd:restriction base="comp:SolarReadyAlternativeEfficiencyMeasure">
                  <xsd:enumeration value="ChargingSpaceForEV"/>
                  <xsd:enumeration value="NoEfficiencyMeasure"/>
                </xsd:restriction>
              </xsd:simpleType>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="I02f_BuildingPlanName" type="comp:BuildingPlanName">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Location in contract documents:</xsd:documentation>
                <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input</xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="IErrorMessage_SectionErrorMessage" type="comp:SectionErrorMessage" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
          </xsd:sequence>
        </xsd:complexType>
      </xsd:element>
      <xsd:element name="Section_J" minOccurs="0">
        <xsd:annotation>
          <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">
            <d:b>J. PHOTOVOLTAIC (PV) AND BATTERY ENERGY STORAGE SYSTEMS</d:b>
          </xsd:documentation>
          <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">
This section is required if Bpv01e_SnowLoadException == false And  Bpv01f_MultiTenantException == false And A05_RoofConstRangeSolar != AddAltRoofLTE2000ft2
And A04_WholeBuildingOccupancy includes  only one or more of the following EventsExhibits, LibraryBuilding, HotelMotel, OfficeBuilding, FinancialInstitutionBuilding, UnleasedTenantSpace, MedicalClinicBuilding, RestaurantBuilding, RetailBuilding, GroceryStoreBuilding, SchoolBuilding, Warehouse, ReligiousFacilityBuilding, SportsRecreation, HighRiseResidential
Or If A04a_OtherFloorArea == true

If sum of square footage LT 80%, 
D03_ExceptionalConditionMessageCCSABE BuildingOccupancyLT80Pct
               </xsd:documentation>
          <xsd:documentation source="MinOccurs">If this section doesn't apply, do not display anything for this section</xsd:documentation>
        </xsd:annotation>
        <xsd:complexType>
          <xsd:sequence>
            <xsd:element name="PvBat_BeginNote1" minOccurs="0">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                  <d:i>  This table documents compliance with prescriptive photovoltaic and battery system requirements in <d:t24refnolink/>140.10/ <d:t24refnolink/>170.2(g and h). Unless the project meets one of the listed exceptions, or trades-off PV in an energy model using performance path, <d:t24refnolink/>140.10/ <d:t24refnolink/>170.2(g and h) requires installed photovoltaic and battery systems for newly constructed buildings.  The installed PV systems must meet the minimum requirements in Joint Appendix 11.</d:i>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
            </xsd:element>
            <xsd:element name="TablePv">
              <xsd:annotation>
                <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">
                  <d:b>Photovoltaic (PV) System</d:b>
                </xsd:documentation>
              </xsd:annotation>
              <xsd:complexType>
                <xsd:sequence>
                  <xsd:element name="TablePV_EquationSubheading" minOccurs="0">
                    <xsd:annotation>
                      <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                      <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">
                        <d:b>Equation 140.10-A/170.2-D Calculation Method</d:b>
                      </xsd:documentation>
                    </xsd:annotation>
                  </xsd:element>
                  <xsd:element name="Row" minOccurs="1" maxOccurs="unbounded">
                    <xsd:complexType>
                      <xsd:sequence>
                        <xsd:element name="Pv01_WholeBuildingOccupancy" maxOccurs="1">
                          <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Building Type</xsd:documentation>
                            <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User selects one from list of occupancies</xsd:documentation>
                            <xsd:appinfo source="displayterm">
                              <dtyp:displayterm value="HighRiseResidential">High-rise multifamily</dtyp:displayterm>
                              <dtyp:displayterm value="MedicalClinicBuilding">Medical Office/Clinic</dtyp:displayterm>
                              <dtyp:displayterm value="UnleasedTenantSpace">Tenant Space <d:lte/>2,000 ft2 in Multitenant Building</dtyp:displayterm>
                            </xsd:appinfo>
                          </xsd:annotation>
                          <xsd:simpleType>
                            <xsd:restriction base="com:WholeBuildingOccupancy">
                              <xsd:enumeration value="EventsExhibits"/>
                              <xsd:enumeration value="FinancialInstitutionBuilding"/>
                              <xsd:enumeration value="GroceryStoreBuilding"/>
                              <xsd:enumeration value="HighRiseResidential"/>
                              <xsd:enumeration value="HotelMotel"/>
                              <xsd:enumeration value="LibraryBuilding"/>
                              <xsd:enumeration value="MedicalClinicBuilding"/>
                              <xsd:enumeration value="OfficeBuilding"/>
                              <xsd:enumeration value="RestaurantBuilding"/>
                              <xsd:enumeration value="RetailBuilding"/>
                              <xsd:enumeration value="SchoolBuilding"/>
                              <xsd:enumeration value="SportsRecreation"/>
                              <xsd:enumeration value="TenantSpaceGT2000"/>
                              <xsd:enumeration value="ReligiousFacilityBuilding"/>
                              <xsd:enumeration value="UnleasedTenantSpace"/>
                              <xsd:enumeration value="Warehouse"/>
                            </xsd:restriction>
                          </xsd:simpleType>
                        </xsd:element>
                        <xsd:element name="Pv02_ConditionedFloorArea" type="com:ConditionedFloorArea">
                          <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation source="FieldText">Conditioned Floor Area (ft<d:sup>2</d:sup>)</xsd:documentation>
                            <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules">User input; area</xsd:documentation>
                          </xsd:annotation>
                        </xsd:element>
                        <xsd:element name="Pv03ColumnHeading" minOccurs="0">
                          <xsd:annotation>
                            <xsd:documentation source="FieldText"/>
                            <xsd:documentation source="AdditionalRequirements">Tenant Space Exception to <d:t24refnolink/>140.10(a)/<d:t24refnolink/>170.2(g) (Must check all to meet Exception)</xsd:documentation>
                            <xsd:documentation source="CalculationsAndRules"> 
                                          If Pv03a_PvTenantExempt_RequirementSatisfied And Pv03b_PvTenantExempt_RequirementSatisfied And Pv03c_PvTenantExempt_RequirementSatisfied And Pv03d_PvTenantExempt_RequirementSatisfied == true;
                                          D03_ExceptionalConditionMessageCCSABE += PVExempt2000SF</xsd:documentation>
